-**Proposed disposition: Change.** Preserve one coherent report. Replace open-ended tool-owned blobs and hard-coded tool authority with versioned host-approved projections. Tool identity can organize presentation; it cannot override runs, selection, findings or policy. Preserve reserved host-owned top-level keys. Registered external report hooks execute only in the supervised isolated worker lane; there is no in-host fallback. Trusted built-in projection code remains separately owned by the host.
